# Logs
*.log

# Local operator scripts -- kept out of the repo because they exist to handle
# credentials on a machine that already has them (setting the seeded admin's
# password, seeding content through the live API). Ignored rather than
# committed so they stop showing as untracked forever; if one of them ever
# needs to be shared, commit a version that takes the secret as a parameter
# rather than the one that has been run against a real password.
/set-admin-password.ps1
/run-seed.ps1
/run-seed.sh
